{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2022-07-05 14:15:00', 'title': 'AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL WELCOMES JENNIFER MARCONTELL AND HER TEAM, TOP-RANKED ADVISORY PRACTICE MANAGING $1.7 BILLION IN ASSETS', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--A TOP-RANKED BARRON'S FINANCIAL ADVISOR, JENNIFER MARCONTELL, CFP®, CHFC®, AAMS®, CRPC®, APMA® AND HER TEAM, RECENTLY JOINED THE INDEPENDENT CHANNEL OF AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: AMP) FROM EDWARD JONES IN BAYTOWN, TEXAS WITH $1.7 BILLION IN ASSETS. MARCONTELL AND HER TEAM, WHO NOW OPERATE UNDER THE NAME MARCONTELL WEALTH MANAGEMENT, TRANSITIONED TO AMERIPRISE TO TAKE THEIR WEALTH MANAGEMENT CAPABILITIES TO THE NEXT LEVEL WITH ENHANCEMENTS OFFERED BY AMERIPRI"}